    "description": "🌿 Your Himalayan escape is waiting! 🏔️\n\nLeave the city behind and experience the peaceful charm of Laliguras Homestay, Gorkhey — where rivers, pine forests, mountain views, and warm hospitality come together.\n\n✨ Stay Includes\n🍽️ 4 Delicious Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Evening Snacks + Chai Pakora & Dinner)\n🏡 Cozy village homestay\n🌊 Riverside walks\n🥾 Local sightseeing & Samanden trek\n🔥 Bonfire & local food experiences\n\n🍛 Don’t miss our authentic Nepali Thali and delicious homemade local dishes.\n\n📍 Route:\nNJP → Jorethang → Pattharay (Bhareng) → 45-minute scenic walk to Laliguras Homestay\n\n💰 Starting from:\n🥗 ₹1,000/person/night (Veg)\n🍗 ₹1,200/person/night (Non-Veg)\n\n\nCome for the mountains. Stay for the memories. ❤️🌲\n\n",
